# Active workflows in lhpaul/ronda as of the audit cutoff 2026-09-23T10:36:01Z
# (the merge of PR #100). Pinned so that the historical audit table stays
# reproducible: querying current workflow state would let a later rename,
# addition, removal, or disablement change the output for this fixed window.
#
# Regenerate ONLY when defining a new window:
#   gh api repos/<owner>/<repo>/actions/workflows --paginate \
#     --jq '.workflows[] | select(.state == "active") | .name' | sort
#
# One workflow name per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
